etadata":{"title":"Perpetua starts construction on Stibnite mine amid ongoing legal battles","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/06/11/perpetua-starts-construction-on-stibnite-mine-amid-ongoing-legal-battles/","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-06-11","created":"2026-07-08","description":"Work to build a new road to a gold and antimony mine in eastern Valley County is underway after a favorable court ruling for the mine.  Boise-based Perpetua Resources recently started a three-year, $2.6 billion construction phase needed to develop its Stibnite Gold Project following a May 29 decision by U.S. District Judge Amanda Brailsford.  […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},